<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Account Deletion & Support - Chess King</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0d1117;
            --card-bg: #161b22;
            --border-color: #30363d;
            --text-main: #c9d1d9;
            --text-muted: #8b949e;
            --accent-red: #da3633;
            --accent-blue: #58a6ff;
            --accent-hover: #1f6feb;
            --step-bg: #21262d;
        }
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.7;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        .wrapper {
            max-width: 850px;
            width: 100%;
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 50px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
        }
        header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-bottom: 25px;
        }
        header h1 {
            font-size: 34px;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        header p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        section {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        h2 {
            font-size: 22px;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-blue);
            padding-left: 12px;
        }
        p {
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        
        /* Guide Steps Styling */
        .guide-box {
            background-color: var(--step-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 25px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .step-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            gap: 15px;
        }
        .step-item:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }
        .step-number {
            background-color: var(--accent-blue);
            color: #ffffff;
            font-weight: bold;
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .step-content {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }
        .step-content strong {
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .highlight-danger {
            color: #ff7b72;
            font-weight: bold;
            background-color: rgba(218, 54, 51, 0.15);
            padding: 2px 6px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(218, 54, 51, 0.4);
        }

        /* Data Section */
        .data-list {
            background-color: var(--step-bg);
            padding: 20px 25px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }
        .data-list ul {
            list-style-type: disc;
            margin-left: 20px;
        }
        .data-list li {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        /* Support Box */
        .support-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #161b22, #21262d);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 35px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .email-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: var(--accent-blue);
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 14px 30px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 17px;
            margin-top: 15px;
            transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
        }
        .email-btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--accent-hover);
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-top: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="wrapper">
        <header>
            <h1>Chess King - Account Deletion & Privacy Support</h1>
            <p>Complete guide on how to delete your account, manage your data, or contact customer support.</p>
        </header>

        <!-- Detailed In-App Instructions -->
        <section>
            <h2>How to Delete Your Account Inside the App</h2>
            <p>You can easily delete your <strong>Chess King</strong> account and permanently wipe all your data at any time directly from within the game interface by following this detailed step-by-step guide:</p>
            
            <div class="guide-box">
                <div class="step-item">
                    <div class="step-number">1</div>
                    <div class="step-content">
                        <strong>Open your Profile:</strong> Launch the <strong>Chess King</strong> app on your device and navigate to your main <strong>Profile</strong> screen from the top or navigation menu.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="step-item">
                    <div class="step-number">2</div>
                    <div class="step-content">
                        <strong>Access Edit Profile:</strong> On the Profile screen, locate and tap the <strong>Pencil icon (Edit Profile)</strong> located at the top corner of the screen. This will open the profile customization menu.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="step-item">
                    <div class="step-number">3</div>
                    <div class="step-content">
                        <strong>Scroll to the Bottom:</strong> Inside the <strong>Edit Profile</strong> interface, scroll down past your social media and background options until you reach the <strong>very bottom of the page</strong>.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="step-item">
                    <div class="step-number">4</div>
                    <div class="step-content">
                        <strong>Confirm Account Deletion:</strong> At the bottom, tap the red <span class="highlight-danger">Delete account</span> button. Confirm the confirmation pop-up to instantly wipe your profile, match rankings, and account credentials.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- What Data gets deleted -->
        <section>
            <h2>What Data Will Be Deleted?</h2>
            <p>When you trigger the account deletion process, all of your associated records are permanently erased from our servers, including:</p>
            <div class="data-list">
                <ul>
                    <li>Your registered account credentials (email, password hashes, and linked social IDs).</li>
                    <li>All game statistics, ELO ratings, match histories, and leaderboard rankings.</li>
                    <li>Your friends list, match invitations, and in-game text messages/chat logs.</li>
                    <li>Custom profile avatar configurations, badges, and unlocked preferences.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Manual Email Support Section -->
        <section>
            <h2>Need Assistance or Manual Deletion?</h2>
            <p>If you face any difficulty accessing your account, experience technical issues in-app, or wish to request manual deletion by our privacy team, please contact our support desk directly via email. We process all manual requests within 48 hours.</p>
            
            <div class="support-box">
                <p style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;">Contact Customer Support & Data Protection</p>
                <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px; margin-top: 5px;">Send your account email address and deletion request to:</p>
                <a href="mailto:green.store.support@gmail.com" class="email-btn">green.store.support@gmail.com</a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <footer>
            <p>&copy; 2026 Chess King. Developed by Green Store LLC. All rights reserved.</p>
        </footer>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
